{"id":"honesty","path":"docs/research/honesty-audit.md","title":"Scientific Honesty Audit: FeCIM Lattice Tools","category":"Trust","sha256":"5b382ee0fd9d83a222e1b7ed490d78ab83cd33b07430084bebf94f5e6aa7124c","rights":"MIT","attribution":"FeCIM Lattice Tools contributors (repository-authored Markdown; publisher assets excluded)","bytes":10133,"terms":["BEOL","Ec","Endurance","FeCIM","HZO","Hysteresis Loop","MAC","MNIST Accuracy","Pr","Remnant Polarization","Retention Time","TOPS/W","TRL","Write Energy"],"headings":[{"text":"Scientific Honesty Audit: FeCIM Lattice Tools","level":1,"anchor":"scientific-honesty-audit-fecim-lattice-tools"},{"text":"Summary","level":2,"anchor":"summary"},{"text":"Corrected claims — 2026-10-25","level":2,"anchor":"corrected-claims--2026-10-25"},{"text":"Verified Claims (External)","level":2,"anchor":"verified-claims-external"},{"text":"Unverified or Assumed Claims (Do Not Present as Facts)","level":2,"anchor":"unverified-or-assumed-claims-do-not-present-as-facts"},{"text":"Policy","level":2,"anchor":"policy"},{"text":"Scope","level":2,"anchor":"scope"},{"text":"Validation Bridge (Internal \u003c-\u003e External)","level":2,"anchor":"validation-bridge-internal---external"},{"text":"Literature-context scalar checks (not independent curve validation)","level":3,"anchor":"literature-context-scalar-checks-not-independent-curve-validation"},{"text":"Still Lacking External Validation","level":3,"anchor":"still-lacking-external-validation"},{"text":"Methodology","level":3,"anchor":"methodology"},{"text":"Notes","level":2,"anchor":"notes"}],"nodes":[{"kind":"heading","level":1,"anchor":"scientific-honesty-audit-fecim-lattice-tools","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Scientific Honesty Audit: FeCIM Lattice Tools"}]},{"kind":"quote","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note:"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" This file was previously located at "},{"kind":"code","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"docs/comparison/HONESTY_AUDIT.md"}]},{"kind":"text","text":". It has moved to "},{"kind":"code","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"docs/research/honesty-audit.md"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Version:"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" 4.3 | "},{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Date:"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" 2026-10-25 | "},{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Status:"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" Active (verified + unverified tagged)"}]},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"summary","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Summary"}]},{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This repository is "},{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"simulation-only"}]},{"kind":"text","text":". External scientific claims must be explicitly verified before being presented as facts. If a claim is not listed in "},{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Verified Claims"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" below, treat it as "},{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"unverified"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"assumed"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" and label it accordingly."}]},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"corrected-claims--2026-10-25","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Corrected claims — 2026-10-25"}]},{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Park reference correction:"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" the former "},{"kind":"code","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"park2015_fig2a_hzo_10nm.csv"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" was described as a digitized Park 2015 loop and used in literature-agreement/calibration wording. That provenance is not established. It is now "},{"kind":"code","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"validation/literature/data/park2015_synthetic_shape.csv"}]},{"kind":"text","text":", labeled "},{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"synthetic regression data"}]},{"kind":"text","text":", with a provenance header and sidecar. Numeric samples are unchanged. The related generator is model-based; its exact historical revision is unknown, and today's generator does not reproduce the polarization samples exactly. Do not describe a small residual as measured Park agreement."}]},{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A distinct illustrative JSON, formerly "},{"kind":"code","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"validation/testdata/literature/park_2015_hzo_pe_loop.json"}]},{"kind":"text","text":", also claimed published Figure 2a data. It is now explicitly synthetic/non-experimental numerical-fit regression data with unverified historical origin, named "},{"kind":"code","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"park2015_synthetic_calibration_shape.json"}]},{"kind":"text","text":". Its tanh-fit test and physics-realism audit no longer claim published HZO agreement; its origin is not assumed identical to the CSV."}]},{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Corrected consumers include fitting tests, legacy preset display names/comments, FORC targets, P–E and chi-squared reports, committed regression artifacts, citation notes, guides, and both manuscript drafts. Derived artifacts explicitly distinguish numerical regression success from experimental validation. Genuine scalar literature-range checks are separate plausibility checks, not authentication of the synthetic curve."}]},{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A separate Park figure-metrics JSON had unsupported extraction provenance and different scalar values; it is "},{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"unverified"}]},{"kind":"text","text":", not presumed identical to the synthetic CSV, and is quarantined outside experimental-data ingestion. The BTO pixel-extracted trace has large within-branch jumps and is "},{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"excluded pending independent re-digitization"}]},{"kind":"text","text":". Its numerical samples are retained unchanged; smoothing is not an acceptable correction."}]},{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"See "},{"kind":"link","url":"doc:park-correction","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"the full inventory and evidence boundary"}]},{"kind":"text","text":". No experimental validation claim is reinstated by these corrections."}]},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"verified-claims-external","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Verified Claims (External)"}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":true,"children":[{"kind":"item","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"98.24% MNIST accuracy"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" reported for "},{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"HZO ferroelectric tunnel junction (FTJ) reservoir computing"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" in "},{"kind":"em","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Journal of Alloys and Compounds"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" (2025), DOI: "},{"kind":"code","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"10.1016/j.jallcom.2025.181869"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"."}]},{"kind":"list","children":[{"kind":"item","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Scope note:"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" This is "},{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"not"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" a FeCIM device claim and should not be attributed to this simulator. It is a literature benchmark for a related ferroelectric device."}]}]}]}]},{"kind":"item","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"97% MNIST accuracy with a current limiter, vs 9.8% without it"}]},{"kind":"text","text":", reported for a "},{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"28 nm HKMG-based current-limited FeFET crossbar array"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" in "},{"kind":"em","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"IEEE Transactions on Electron Devices"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" (2022), DOI: "},{"kind":"code","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"10.1109/TED.2022.3216973"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"."}]},{"kind":"list","children":[{"kind":"item","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Scope note:"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" This is an external device-paper benchmark, not a result produced by this simulator."}]}]},{"kind":"item","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Boundary note:"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" Treat it as evidence that current limiting can materially change inference quality in FeFET crossbars, not as a blanket accuracy claim for all FeCIM arrays."}]}]}]}]},{"kind":"item","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"96.64% MNIST accuracy (4-state FeFET, sigma=40mV)"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" reported for "},{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"28nm HKMG multi-level FeFET crossbar"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" in "},{"kind":"em","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Nature Communications"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" 14, 6348 (2023), DOI: "},{"kind":"code","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"10.1038/s41467-023-42110-y"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"."}]},{"kind":"list","children":[{"kind":"item","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Scope note:"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" 32x32 array, 2-bit MAC, 885 TOPS/W. External benchmark — not this simulator."}]}]},{"kind":"item","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Key detail:"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" Vth sigma=38mV, 4 conductance states, "},{"kind":"text","text":"\u003c1 fJ write energy."}]}]}]}]},{"kind":"item","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"90 conductance states, 99.8% tracking accuracy"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" reported for "},{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2D ferroelectric-gated hybrid CIM"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" in "},{"kind":"em","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Science Advances"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" (2024), DOI: "},{"kind":"code","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"10.1126/sciadv.adp0174"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"."}]},{"kind":"list","children":[{"kind":"item","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Scope note:"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" HZO 20nm + MoS2 channel, 2Pr=49.5 µC/cm², ON/OFF \u003e10^7, C2C variation 0.3%."}]}]},{"kind":"item","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Key detail:"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" 26.3 TOPS/W, \u003e10^12 endurance cycles, 3 fJ/bit programming."}]}]}]}]},{"kind":"item","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Automated Preisach parameter extraction"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" for fluorite ferroelectrics validated against experimental HZO P-E data in "},{"kind":"em","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Scientific Reports"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" (2021), DOI: "},{"kind":"code","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"10.1038/s41598-021-91492-w"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"."}]},{"kind":"list","children":[{"kind":"item","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"strong","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Scope note:"}]},{"kind":"text","text":" Methodology paper for calibrating Preisach models to measured hysteresis loops."}]}]}]}]}]},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"unverified-or-assumed-claims-do-not-present-as-facts","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Unverified or Assumed Claims (Do Not Present as Facts)"}]},{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following appear in historical docs, research notes, or prior drafts. They ar