etic fixture is regression-only, not experimental agreement. The unsupported Park scalar JSON and disputed BTO trace are excluded; remaining experimental-data checks require their own source review."}]}]}]},{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Full benchmark reference: "},{"kind":"code","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"docs/research/validation/external/external-benchmarks.md"}]}]},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"notes","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Notes"}]},{"kind":"paragraph","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If additional claims are verified in the future, update this file first, then update downstream documentation to match."}]}]}
